  "id": "grilled-london-broil",
  "name": "Grilled London Broil",
  "subtitle": "Herb-seasoned grilled top round",
  "description": "Top round is tenderized, marinated with lemon, garlic, herbs, and vinegar, then grilled and rested before slicing.",
